%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 24cee7e49fc532a45ab71bd5ace6cb7b, type: 3}
  m_Name: S1pre
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: You don't realize which goodbye was the last until long afterward.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uB9C8\uC9C0\uB9C9 \uC778\uC0AC\uB294 \uB298 \uC9C0\uB09C \uB4A4\uC5D0\uC57C
      \uC54C\uAC8C \uB41C\uB2E4"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: For decades, this land had been nearly bone-dry, and familiar
      faces slipped away like sand through open fingers.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uBA87\uC2ED \uB144\uC9F8 \uAC70\uC758 \uB9D0\uB77C\uBC84\uB9B0
      \uC774 \uB545\uC5D0\uC11C, \uACC1\uC5D0 \uC788\uB358 \uC5BC\uAD74\uB4E4\uC740
      \uC190\uAC00\uB77D \uC0AC\uC774 \uBAA8\uB798\uCC98\uB7FC \uBE60\uC838\uB098\uAC14\uB2E4"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: Piper was the brightest of them all, and the biggest dreamer.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C\uB294 \uADF8\uC911\uC5D0\uC11C\uB3C4 \uAC00\uC7A5
      \uBC1D\uACE0 \uB0AD\uB9CC\uC801\uC778 \uC544\uC774\uC600\uB2E4"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: She was always talking, so the well had no right to be this quiet
      without her.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8 \uC544\uC774\uB294 \uB9D0\uC774 \uCC38 \uB9CE\uC558\uAE30\uC5D0,
      \uADF8\uB140\uAC00 \uC5C6\uB294 \uC6B0\uBB3C\uAC00\uB294 \uC774\uD1A0\uB85D
      \uC870\uC6A9\uD560 \uC218\uAC00 \uC5C6\uC5C8\uB2E4"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: She was already gone. In the end, all that remained was her voice,
      lingering somewhere deep within.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB140\uB294 \uC774\uBBF8 \uB5A0\uB0AC\uACE0, \uACB0\uAD6D
      \uB9C8\uC74C\uC18D\uC5D0 \uBAA9\uC18C\uB9AC\uB9CC \uB0A8\uC558\uB2E4"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: "The one left behind would carry that voice for years and years,
      until one day even that\u2014"
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uB0A8\uC740 \uC0AC\uB78C\uC740 \uADF8 \uBAA9\uC18C\uB9AC\uB97C
      \uC624\uB798\uC624\uB798 \uD488\uACE0 \uB2E4\uB2C8\uB2E4\uAC00, \uC5B4\uB290
      \uB0A0\uC5D4 \uADF8\uB9C8\uC800\u2014"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: ...What are you even talking about?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\u2026\u2026\uBB50\uB77C\uB294 \uAC70\uC57C?"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: I'm right here, you know? ...Did the heat finally get to her?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC800 \uC5EC\uAE30 \uC788\uAC70\uB4E0\uC694? ...\uB354\uC704
      \uBA39\uC5C8\uB098?"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: 
    dialogueTextEN: Piper stood there with an empty bucket in one hand, looking utterly
      baffled.
    speakerNameKR: 
    dialogueTextKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C\uAC00 \uBE48 \uBB3C\uD1B5\uC744 \uD55C \uC190\uC5D0
      \uB4E0 \uCC44, \uC5B4\uC774\uC5C6\uB2E4\uB294 \uC5BC\uAD74\uB85C \uC11C \uC788\uC5C8\uB2E4"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Oh. You're back.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC5B4, \uC654\uAD6C\uB098."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Faster than I expected. You could've taken your time.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC0DD\uAC01\uBCF4\uB2E4 \uBE68\uB9AC \uC654\uB124. \uC880 \uB354
      \uCC9C\uCC9C\uD788 \uC640\uB3C4 \uB410\uB294\uB370."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Taken my time? What, so you could finish my funeral first?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC880 \uB354 \uCC9C\uCC9C\uD788 \uC640\uC694? \uC81C \uC7A5\uB840\uC2DD\uC774\uB77C\uB3C4
      \uB9C8\uC800 \uCE58\uB974\uC2DC\uAC8C?"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: ...So how was the well over there? Any sign of water?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "...\uC800\uCABD \uC6B0\uBB3C\uC740 \uC5B4\uB560\uC5B4? \uBB3C\uC774
      \uC870\uAE08\uC774\uB77C\uB3C4 \uB098\uC624\uB294 \uAC83 \uAC19\uC544?"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Seriously... That one's hopeless too. How about yours?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uCC38 \uB098... \uC800\uCABD\uB3C4 \uAC00\uB9DD\uC774 \uC5C6\uC5B4\uC694.
      \uD14C\uC0AC \uCABD\uC740\uC694?"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Nothing yet, but look here. Feels like we could get something
      flowing if we hit it just right, doesn't it?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC9C0\uAE08\uC740 \uC548 \uB098\uC624\uB294\uB370, \uC5EC\uAE30
      \uBCF4\uBA74 \uC798 \uAC74\uB4DC\uB9AC\uBA74 \uD130\uC838 \uB098\uC62C \uAC83
      \uAC19\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC544?"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Oh, you're right. So why weren't you working on it?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC5B4, \uADF8\uB7EC\uB124\uC694? \uADFC\uB370 \uC65C \uC791\uC5C5
      \uC548 \uD558\uACE0 \uC788\uC5C8\uC5B4\uC694?"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: You're better at this than I am these days. I was waiting for
      our ace.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC694\uC998\uC5D4 \uB108\uAC00 \uB354 \uC190\uC7AC\uC8FC\uAC00
      \uC88B\uC796\uC544. \uC6B0\uB9AC \uC5D0\uC774\uC2A4\uB97C \uAE30\uB2E4\uB9AC\uACE0
      \uC788\uC5C8\uC9C0."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: You just couldn't be bothered...
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB0E5 \uADC0\uCC2E\uC558\uB358 \uAC70\uBA74\uC11C..."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
